DESCRIPTION:How well do you know the ground you walk on? Join us for an in
 teractive scavenger hunt celebrating the Semi-quincentennial. Using our ev
 ent app\, you'll explore the landmarks and "unsung heroes" that have shape
 d The Town of Waterford over the last two and a half centuries. It's more 
 than a game-it's a chance to see our town's role in the American story. Pe
 rfect for history buffs and curious neighbors alike.\n\nSource: https://ct
 visit.com/events/exploring-waterford-history-scavenger-hunt
